    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">Best Visa for Remote Workers Moving to Spain in 2026</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">If you work remotely and want to move to Spain, you have more visa options than you might think — and more reasons to choose carefully. The wrong visa can leave you legally non-compliant, tax-inefficient, or with awkward renewal situations. Here's how the options compare for remote workers.</p>
